  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat a skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "2. In a shallow dish, mix together almond flour and parmesan cheese.",
    "3. Coat the paneer in the almond flour mixture, shaking off excess.",
    "4. Add olive oil to the preheated skillet and swirl to coat.",
    "5. Pan-fry the coated paneer for 2-3 minutes on each side, until golden brown.",
    "6. Remove the paneer from the skillet and season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "7. Garnish with chopped parsley, if desired.",
    "8. Serve immediately and enjoy!"
